        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>附录二 可持续发展相关风险和机遇 — 2024·美的集团ESG报告</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    color: #231f20;\n  }\n  .spread {\n    width: 2340px;\n    max-width: 100%;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 60px 70px 40px 70px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Running head ---------- */\n  .runhead {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #231f20;\n    margin-bottom: 100px;\n  }\n  .runhead .left { font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .5px; }\n  .runhead .nav { display: flex; gap: 26px; align-items: center; }\n  .runhead .nav span { color: #231f20; }\n  .runhead .nav .current {\n    color: #0a8ede;\n    border: 1px solid #0a8ede;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 3px 14px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Title row ---------- */\n  .titlerow {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    margin-bottom: 34px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 40px;\n    color: #0a8ede;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .legend {\n    background: #f2f4f6;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 9px 22px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .legend .item { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-right: 8px; }\n  sup { font-size: 10px; }\n\n  /* ---------- Icons ---------- */\n  .ico {\n    width: 22px; height: 22px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    display: inline-block;\n    flex: 0 0 22px;\n  }\n  .ico.short { background: #f6a23c; }\n  .ico.mid   { background: #9aa4ac; }\n  .ico.long  { background: #3cc27a; }\n\n  /* ---------- Two page columns ---------- */\n  .pages { display: flex; gap: 90px; align-items: flex-start; }\n  .page { flex: 1 1 0; min-width: 0; }\n\n  /* ---------- Rows ---------- */\n  .row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: stretch;\n    border: 1px solid #17a5e0;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n    min-height: 76px;\n  }\n  .icocell {\n    flex: 0 0 62px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .textcell {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    padding: 12px 18px 12px 0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .tagcell {\n    flex: 0 0 168px;\n    background: #109fdc;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    padding: 12px 16px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  /* right page order: tag first, then text, then icon */\n  .row.right .tagcell { flex: 0 0 172px; }\n  .row.right .textcell { padding: 12px 18px; }\n\n  /* ---------- Footnote ---------- */\n  .footnote {\n    margin-top: 46px;\n    padding-top: 12px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #333;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .footnote:before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0; left: 0;\n    width: 190px;\n    height: 1px;\n    background: #17a5e0;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Folios ---------- */\n  .folios {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #231f20;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"spread\">\n\n  <div class=\"runhead\">\n    <div class=\"left\">2024 · 美的集团ESG报告</div>\n    <div class=\"nav\">\n      <span>关于本报告</span>\n      <span>走进美的</span>\n      <span>可持续发展治理</span>\n      <span>守护蓝色星球</span>\n      <span>构建和谐社区</span>\n      <span>践行科技尽善</span>\n      <span>共创繁荣生态</span>\n      <span class=\"current\">附录</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"titlerow\">\n    <h1>附录二 可持续发展相关风险和机遇</h1>\n    <div class=\"legend\">\n      <span>时间周期<sup>24</sup>：</span>\n      <span class=\"item\"><span class=\"ico short\"></span>短期</span>\n      <span class=\"item\"><span class=\"ico mid\"></span>中期</span>\n      <span class=\"item\"><span class=\"ico long\"></span>长期</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pages\">\n\n    <!-- ============ LEFT PAGE (141) ============ -->\n    <div class=\"page\">\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico short\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">企业应建立完善的环保管理体系，加强环境监测和评估，确保生产活动符合相关标准和法规要求，从而降低环境风险和运营成本。</div>\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">环境<br>合规管理</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico short\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">企业应尊重员工权益，提供平等的工作机会和福利待遇，建立包容性的企业文化，通过吸引和留住来自不同背景的人才，增强创新能力。</div>\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">员工权益与<br>多元化</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico mid\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">企业应建立完善的网络安全防护体系，加强数据管理和监控，确保客户数据的安全和隐私。</div>\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">数据安全与<br>客户隐私保护</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico short\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">企业应加强对供应链中冲突矿产的监控和管理，确保采购的矿产来自合法和可持续的来源，避免出现相关事件的负面声誉与财务影响。</div>\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">冲突<br>矿产管理</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico mid\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">企业应加强对水资源的管理和监控，采用节水技术和工艺，并通过推动水资源循环利用和节水文化建设，降低水资源消耗、污染和利用成本。</div>\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">可持续<br>水资源管理</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico short\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">企业应建立健全的反腐败机制，加强员工教育和培训，确保经营活动的合规性和透明度。</div>\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">反商业贿赂及<br>反贪污</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico short\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">企业在推广产品或服务时，必须遵循真实、准确、透明的原则，避免夸大其词或误导消费者，从而确保企业正面形象。</div>\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">负责任营销与<br>宣传</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico long\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">高效利用能源不仅可以降低企业的运营成本，提高生产效率，还有助于减少对环境的影响。</div>\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">能源利用</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico mid\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">企业应坚决抵制虚假宣传、恶意降价、商业贿赂等不正当竞争行为，通过合法合规的经营方式，树立行业标杆，推动整个行业的健康发展。</div>\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">反不当竞争</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico short\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">企业应严格遵守环保法规，加强污染治理，减少污染物排放，保护生态环境。</div>\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">污染物排放</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico long\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">企业应积极参与社会公益活动，通过捐赠资金、物资、技术支持等方式回馈社会，帮助弱势群体，促进社会和谐稳定。</div>\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">社会贡献</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico long\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">企业应强化知识产权保护，维护合法权益，同时尊重他人知识产权，通过完善管理制度激发创新活力，助力技术进步与产业升级。</div>\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">知识产权保障</div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- ============ RIGHT PAGE (142) ============ -->\n    <div class=\"page\">\n\n      <div class=\"row right\">\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">应对气候变化</div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">随着全球气候变化的日益严峻，企业可通过采用可再生能源、提高能源利用效率、推广绿色产品和服务等方式，积极应对并减缓气候变化的影响。</div>\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico long\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row right\">\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">创新与研发</div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">通过不断探索新技术、新产品和新服务，企业可以保持竞争优势，满足消费者不断变化的需求。同时，研发投资也可能带来财务投入和潜在风险。</div>\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico long\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row right\">\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">产品质量与<br>安全</div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">确保产品符合标准法规，是企业保护消费者的底线。企业需完善质量管理体系，强化检测监控，保障产品质量稳定。</div>\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico long\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row right\">\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">供应链管理与<br>安全</div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">有效的供应链管理可以降低生产成本，供应链的稳定性和可靠性可以防范潜在的风险和中断，企业需要加强供应商管理。</div>\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico long\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row right\">\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">员工健康与<br>安全</div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">企业应提供安全的工作环境，加强员工健康管理和培训，确保员工免受伤害。健康的员工队伍可以提高工作效率和生产力，为企业创造更多价值。</div>\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico short\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row right\">\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">循环经济与<br>废弃物管理</div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">企业循环利用资源、减少废弃物产生并妥善处置，既能降低环境负担、提升资源利用效率，又能借循环经济与绿色生产模式开拓新商机与市场空间。</div>\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico long\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row right\">\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">公司治理</div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">企业应完善治理结构与内控机制，保障决策科学透明合规。深化与股东、投资者及利益相关者的沟通协作，夯实信任基础，提升企业形象声誉。</div>\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico short\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row right\">\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">员工培训与<br>发展</div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">通过提供培训和发展机会，企业可以激发员工潜能，提升其工作效率和生产力，为企业创造更多价值。</div>\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico mid\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row right\">\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">消费者体验</div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">企业应关注消费者需求，不断精进产品和服务，满足消费者不断变化的需求，提升品牌形象和市场份额。</div>\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico short\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row right\">\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">股东权益</div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">企业应确保股东利益得到充分保障，通过建立良好的治理结构、透明的信息披露和合理的股利分配机制，深化股东沟通合作，提升投资者信心。</div>\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico mid\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row right\">\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">促进行业发展</div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">企业应积极参与行业交流与合作，通过分享经验、整合资源、协同合作等方式，共同推动技术创新和产业升级，实现互利共赢。</div>\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico long\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row right\">\n        <div class=\"tagcell\">生物多样性<br>保护</div>\n        <div class=\"textcell\">企业应积极采取措施，保护生态环境和生物多样性，避免对生态系统造成破坏。</div>\n        <div class=\"icocell\"><span class=\"ico long\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"footnote\">\n        <sup>24</sup> 结合美的集团所处行业、公司的战略规划和运营实际，我们的短中长期定义为：短期（0-1年）；中期（1-5年）；长期（5年以上）。\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"folios\">\n    <span>141</span>\n    <span>142</span>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
